WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.102 --> 00:00:01.638
If you're serious about buying a business,

2
00:00:01.638 --> 00:00:02.802
here's the problem:

3
00:00:02.802 --> 00:00:03.930
the best businesses sell

4
00:00:03.930 --> 00:00:05.376
before they're ever listed.

5
00:00:05.376 --> 00:00:07.218
So by the time a deal hits a broker's book,

6
00:00:07.218 --> 00:00:08.184
you're bidding against every

7
00:00:08.184 --> 00:00:09.763
other buyer in the market.

8
00:00:09.763 --> 00:00:12.111
I'm Nate Niehuus, founder of OutSearched,

9
00:00:12.111 --> 00:00:13.129
and I started this company

10
00:00:13.129 --> 00:00:14.303
because I was tired of waiting on

11
00:00:14.303 --> 00:00:16.865
brokers and bankers to bring me deals.

12
00:00:16.865 --> 00:00:18.738
So we built something different.

13
00:00:18.815 --> 00:00:20.192
We find, contact,

14
00:00:20.192 --> 00:00:22.181
and qualify off-market business owners

15
00:00:22.181 --> 00:00:23.905
who match your exact buy box

16
00:00:23.905 --> 00:00:25.239
and we bring them to you.

17
00:00:25.239 --> 00:00:26.405
Here's how it works:

18
00:00:26.405 --> 00:00:28.158
first, we lock in your mandate.

19
00:00:28.158 --> 00:00:29.354
This is going to be size,

20
00:00:29.354 --> 00:00:31.512
geography, vertical and EBITDA.

21
00:00:31.512 --> 00:00:32.864
And then we build a custom

22
00:00:32.864 --> 00:00:34.939
list of every owner who fits.

23
00:00:34.939 --> 00:00:36.583
Second, our team reaches those

24
00:00:36.583 --> 00:00:38.070
owners directly by email,

25
00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:40.836
phone, direct mail and sometimes LinkedIn.

26
00:00:40.836 --> 00:00:42.480
Then we take the first calls,

27
00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:43.619
we screen the owners,

28
00:00:43.619 --> 00:00:46.289
we get NDAs signed, and we pull the financials.

29
00:00:46.289 --> 00:00:48.339
You get a pipeline report every Friday

30
00:00:48.339 --> 00:00:50.604
and a strategy call every other Monday.

31
00:00:50.604 --> 00:00:53.926
Your deal team is live in 21 days.

32
00:00:53.926 --> 00:00:55.354
Most clients are in qualified

33
00:00:55.354 --> 00:00:57.481
owner conversations within 60 days.

34
00:00:57.481 --> 00:00:58.801
And to date, we've brought more than

35
00:00:58.801 --> 00:01:01.966
$500 million in deals to our clients.

36
00:01:01.966 --> 00:01:04.070
You get a full business development team.

37
00:01:04.070 --> 00:01:06.087
Without the hire, without the software,

38
00:01:06.087 --> 00:01:07.630
and without the tire kickers.

39
00:01:07.630 --> 00:01:08.509
So if you're ready to start

40
00:01:08.509 --> 00:01:10.106
your search in the next 60 days,

41
00:01:10.106 --> 00:01:12.084
please apply at the top of the page.

42
00:01:12.084 --> 00:01:13.985
It takes about a minute, and if you're a fit,

43
00:01:13.985 --> 00:01:15.971
you'll pick a time with me right there.

44
00:01:15.971 --> 00:01:17.655
On the call, we'll map your buy box and

45
00:01:17.655 --> 00:01:19.866
show you exactly how we build your pipeline.
